# The first 5th job skill written, and the only one: nothing reaches the stage
# that buys it -- a character's job_stage stops at 4 -- so it is unbuyable and
# its page never draws. It is here because Evil Eye - Reinforce names it, and a
# boost may only name a skill the catalog holds.
#
# GMS gates it on Evil Eye of Domination being up, which is permanent here, and
# spends 1000 MP, which this game has nothing to spend. What is left is the
# shout itself: an eye that appears every 20 seconds and hits ten enemies six
# times, ignoring a fifth of their defence.
name: "Radiant Evil"
skill_order: 1
description:
  "The Evil Eye reveals itself and blasts nearby enemies. Only usable while "
  "Evil Eye of Domination is active."
kind: SKILL_KIND_AUTO_ATTACK
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_DARK_KNIGHT_V
max_level: 30
max_enemies: 10
lines: 6
cast_interval_seconds: 20.0
base {
  skill_pct: 1.15
  ied_pct: 0.20
}
per_level { skill_pct: 0.05 }
